      <title>House votes to make Flamingo Florida’s next state bird</title>
      <link>https://www.wuft.org/fresh-take-florida/2026-02-11/house-votes-to-make-flamingo-floridas-next-state-bird</link>
      <description>Florida’s House voted late Wednesday to establish the American flamingo as the new state bird, a step toward knocking the mockingbird off its perch after nearly a century. It wasn’t immediately clear whether the Senate will go along with the plan.</description>
